      "id": "request-not-promise",
      "title": "A Request Is Not a Promise",
      "description": "Separate the body command, vessel check and optional additions refusal without resolving the RFC’s media-type conflict.",
      "revision": 2,
      "modelRevision": "sha256:a5135eb2ee813deb6893dcf7ce2ef99c6e3f9f460b0659ddd0a25ce3af2c1fc4",
